// M4 — Google Maps native SDK key (iOS).
//
// Copy this file to `ios/Flutter/Secrets.xcconfig` (git-ignored) and set your
// iOS-restricted Maps SDK key. The Debug/Release xcconfigs `#include?` it
// optionally, so a missing file does not break the build: MAPS_API_KEY then
// resolves to "" and AppDelegate skips GMSServices.provideAPIKey → ships dark.
//
// This is the SDK (native) key restricted to the app's bundle id, NOT the
// Routes key (Routes keys are passed at build time via --dart-define).
MAPS_API_KEY=
